OL,3,AGermany's far-right AfD set for big win
OL,4,Ain eastern state, just short of
OL,5,Amajority
OL,6,
OL,7,FGermany's Alternative for Germany (AfD)
OL,8,Fis heading for a dramatic victory in
OL,9,Fthe eastern state of Saxony-Anhalt, far
OL,10,Fahead of its mainstream rivals.
OL,11,FAlthough it is projected to fall short
OL,12,Fof a majority, the AfD says it has won
OL,13,Fa mandate to govern.
OL,15,FThe far-right AfD is on course to win a
OL,16,Frecord 44% of the vote, well ahead of
OL,17,Fthe conservative CDU on 17%, with most
OL,18,Finterim results counted.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
